<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Choice renews cautionary over talks.</title>
<headline>Choice renews cautionary over talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Choice Holdings Ltd on Thursday advised shareholders it was still in negotiations which, if successful, could affect the price at which the company's shares trade on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in its shares pending a further announcement. The company first cautioned shareholders on May 27.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
